    "insight_copy_section_mw8cE4": {
      "type": "insight-copy-section",
      "name": "Insight Copy Section",
      "settings": {
        "large_headline": "Depth-Specific Targeting",
        "copy": "<p>The system's handpiece design allows for tissue-level selectivity. Superficial settings address dermal tightening and skin quality, while deeper settings target subcutaneous adipose tissue for fat reduction and cellulite improvement. This makes it possible to treat skin laxity and localized fat deposits, including hormonally driven accumulation in the flanks, abdomen, and arms, within the same session.</p>"
      }
    },
