    "insight_copy_section_G6tzyd": {
      "type": "insight-copy-section",
      "name": "Insight Copy Section",
      "settings": {
        "large_headline": "Who Should Consider This",
        "copy": "<p>I encourage patients to think about OndaPro as a proactive tool, not just a corrective one. The best outcomes in aging skin come from intervening early, before laxity becomes pronounced. If you are in your 40s or 50s, maintaining your body well, and beginning to notice early changes in skin texture or contour, this is precisely the window where this technology performs best.</p><p>It is also well suited for targeted concerns including menopausal fat redistribution, post-weight-loss skin changes, arm laxity, and abdominal skin quality following pregnancy or significant lifestyle changes.</p><p>The goal is to keep patients out of the operating room, not by settling for less, but by having a tool that is genuinely effective at the right stage of intervention. OndaPro is that tool.</p>"
      }
    },
